16:38.150 --> 16:39.640
You may be right.

16:41.750 --> 16:44.480
Hah, these fools are unlucky!

16:45.420 --> 16:48.260
What did you say?!
You're going to withdraw?

16:48.260 --> 16:50.760
It can't be helped.

16:50.760 --> 16:54.100
It won't be a performance
without Chiba and Ryusuke.

16:54.100 --> 16:56.000
Even if we did an
impromptu performance,

16:56.000 --> 17:00.100
it won't be worth a tenth
of our usual show.

17:00.100 --> 17:06.280
That may be true, but what about the 500
people waiting for you out in the rain?

17:06.280 --> 17:10.110
Huh? 500 people? That's amazing!

17:10.110 --> 17:14.280
It's not amazing, compared to
the main and second stages.

17:14.280 --> 17:16.290
They're them, we're us.

17:16.290 --> 17:17.350
That's right!

17:17.350 --> 17:21.620
It doesn't matter how many
Ran and Leon gather together!

17:21.620 --> 17:24.960
You guys replaced the disbanded
band Loud [Crime City].

17:26.460 --> 17:30.300
I can feel you guys are special.

17:30.300 --> 17:33.470
I've been through
3 different bands so far...

17:33.470 --> 17:36.140
